# Responsibility: Request cooperative pause or resume for an active manipulation goal.
# An all-zero goal_id addresses the only active goal on a single-goal server.
# The service returns immediately: accepted=true means the request was stored,
# not that motion has already stopped. Feedback first reports pause_pending and
# reports paused only at the next server-defined safe checkpoint. Cancel always
# takes priority over pause and wakes a paused task.
unique_identifier_msgs/UUID goal_id
bool paused
---
# Machine-readable acknowledgement that the request was stored. The message is
# operator context only and must not be parsed by clients.
bool accepted
string message
